cc8f3b3d61053b3044d5719761a53a39a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/f/af9c901cc8f3b3d61053b3044d5719761a53a39a.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"p3wZuMvmku0u85OIQsVSwaZ9yEq\" width=\"440\" height=\"118\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">440×118 5.49 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-414089-i-am-by-default-show-generic-report-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-414089-i-am-by-default-show-generic-report-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>I am by default show generic report.</h3>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/f/fff57e6631b2d674a10c3e86b3b94f8cfddb948a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fff57e6631b2d674a10c3e86b3b94f8cfddb948a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/f/fff57e6631b2d674a10c3e86b3b94f8cfddb948a_2_690x139.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"AwjIONgrx4dYLqTtYVdiJlLkwtk\" width=\"690\" height=\"139\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/f/fff57e6631b2d674a10c3e86b3b94f8cfddb948a_2_690x139.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/f/fff57e6631b2d674a10c3e86b3b94f8cfddb948a_2_1035x208.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/f/fff57e6631b2d674a10c3e86b3b94f8cfddb948a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1357×275 21.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-414089-what-i-want-is-to-by-default-be-shown-my-custom-report-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-414089-what-i-want-is-to-by-default-be-shown-my-custom-report-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>What I want is to by default be shown my custom report.</h3>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3b3b05e9eae064ad7058fe8e1f46faebfcda1275.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3b3b05e9eae064ad7058fe8e1f46faebfcda1275\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3b3b05e9eae064ad7058fe8e1f46faebfcda1275_2_690x109.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8rYCSPgB037bdSrmUwsuQ32Yaih\" width=\"690\" height=\"109\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3b3b05e9eae064ad7058fe8e1f46faebfcda1275_2_690x109.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3b3b05e9eae064ad7058fe8e1f46faebfcda1275_2_1035x163.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3b3b05e9eae064ad7058fe8e1f46faebfcda1275.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1300×206 17.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
