    {
      "id": 414109,
      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2024-06-07T11:54:11.897Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mrkovalski\">@MrKovalski</a>,</p>\n<p>I did it. <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/rocket.png?v=12\" title=\":rocket:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rocket:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>please apply it.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.listview_settings['Lead'] = {\n    refresh: function(listview) {\n        const reportOption = document.querySelector('li[data-view=\"Report\"] a');\n        if (reportOption) {\n            reportOption.addEventListener('click', function(event) {\n                event.preventDefault();\n                event.stopPropagation();\n                window.location.href = '/app/lead/view/report/Lead Report Builder Report';\n            });\n        }\n    }\n};\n</code></pre>\n<p>Please set your Doctype and Report URL in the ListView client script.</p>\n<p><strong>Output:</strong></p>\n<video controls=\"\">\n    <source src=\"https://github.com/Nihantra-Patel/view_video/assets/141945075/69d48ee2-268f-4bc4-a67e-c1e754ebf9e4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/{size}/66573_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
