      "id": 484544,
      "username": "grantler",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-10-21T12:10:15.685Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi i adapted this for the Material Request doctype and it works but for some reason it breaks the status column in list view. can someone provide help ?</p>\n<p>frappe.listview_settings[‘Material Request’] = {<br>\nrefresh: function(listview) {<br>\nconst reportOption = document.querySelector(‘li[data-view=“Report”] a’);<br>\nif (reportOption) {<br>\nreportOption.addEventListener(‘click’, function(event) {<br>\nevent.preventDefault();<br>\nevent.stopPropagation();<br>\nwindow.location.href = ‘/app/query-report/custom report 1’;<br>\n});<br>\n}<br>\n}<br>\n};</p>\n<p>here you can see the status column when the script is enabled vs when its disabled</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/9/a904f7b09df086cf0bf142fcbb0417c8f3ac158d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a904f7b09df086cf0bf142fcbb0417c8f3ac158d\" title=\"Screenshot from 2025-10-21 14-08-29\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/9/a904f7b09df086cf0bf142fcbb0417c8f3ac158d_2_690x223.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-10-21 14-08-29\" data-base62-sha1=\"o7dkNjeAQ3UXGdjgolOFo6CB2r3\" width=\"690\" height=\"223\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/9/a904f7b09df086cf0bf142fcbb0417c8f3ac158d_2_690x223.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/9/a904f7b09df086cf0bf142fcbb0417c8f3ac158d_2_1035x334.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/9/a904f7b09df086cf0bf142fcbb0417c8f3ac158d_2_1380x446.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2025-10-21 14-08-29</span><span class=\"informations\">2046×663 69.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/a/8a4f87938141a0bb3eb2e50ca594ac9a61f0208f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8a4f87938141a0bb3eb2e50ca594ac9a61f0208f\" title=\"Screenshot from 2025-10-21 14-08-44\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a4f87938141a0bb3eb2e50ca594ac9a61f0208f_2_690x223.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-10-21 14-08-44\" data-base62-sha1=\"jJyhv8atNM5e1VwgtngFMChBhDN\" width=\"690\" height=\"223\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a4f87938141a0bb3eb2e50ca594ac9a61f0208f_2_690x223.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a4f87938141a0bb3eb2e50ca594ac9a61f0208f_2_1035x334.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a4f87938141a0bb3eb2e50ca594ac9a61f0208f_2_1380x446.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2025-10-21 14-08-44</span><span class=\"informations\">2046×663 69.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
